{"evidence":[{"sentence_id":0,"text":"Annæus Schjødt (7 March 1888 – 12 October 1972) was a Norwegian lawyer.","title":"Annæus Schjødt"},{"sentence_id":1,"text":" He is best known as the prosecutor of Vidkun Quisling.","title":"Annæus Schjødt"},{"sentence_id":0,"text":"Isaiah Trunk (Polish: Izajasz Trunk ; 1905–1981) was a chief archivist of the Yiddish Scientific Institute YIVO in New York from Warsaw, and the leading historian on the Holocaust.","title":"Isaiah Trunk"},{"sentence_id":1,"text":" Trunk was an expert on Jewish history during the Nazi occupation of Poland.","title":"Isaiah Trunk"},{"sentence_id":2,"text":" A scholar and author originally from Poland, he was the winner of a National Book Award in history for his monograph titled "Judenrat: The Jewish Councils in Eastern Europe Under Nazi Occupation" published in New York by Macmillan in 1972.","title":"Isaiah Trunk"},{"sentence_id":0,"text":"Vidkun Abraham Lauritz Jonssøn Quisling (] ; 18 July 1887 – 24 October 1945) was a Norwegian military officer and politician who nominally headed the government of Norway after the country was occupied by Nazi Germany during World War II.","title":"Vidkun Quisling"},{"sentence_id":0,"text":"Annæus Schjødt (13 February 1920 – 4 November 2014) was a Norwegian barrister.","title":"Annæus Schjødt, Jr."},{"sentence_id":0,"text":"The Manuel Piar Hydroelectric Power Plant (Tocoma Dam) is under construction and it is the last hydroelectric development project in the Lower Caroní River Basin of Venezuela.","title":"Tocoma Dam"},{"sentence_id":1,"text":" The project includes the installation of 2320 MW MW to generate an annual average energy of 12,100 GWh .","title":"Tocoma Dam"},{"sentence_id":2,"text":" Ten Kaplan generator units, of 230 MW , manufactured by Argentinian company IMPSA, were predicted to begin operations between 2012 and 2014.","title":"Tocoma Dam"},{"sentence_id":3,"text":" The first generator was installed but not yet commissioned in April 2012.","title":"Tocoma Dam"},{"sentence_id":4,"text":" Behind scheduled, the dam began to impound its reservoir on 16 November 2015.","title":"Tocoma Dam"},{"sentence_id":5,"text":" These units had the world record as of 2012 in power generation at nominal head for Kaplan turbines.","title":"Tocoma Dam"},{"sentence_id":6,"text":" The diameter of the runner is 8.6 m and nominal head is 34.65 m with claimed output up to 232 MW .","title":"Tocoma Dam"},{"sentence_id":0,"text":"The executive wing of Government of Kerala is State Council of Ministers presided by Governor of the state, who is the nominal head of the government and headed by State Chief Minister Pinarayi Vijayan who is the real head of government and leader of the state cabinet.","title":"Kerala Council of Ministers"},{"sentence_id":1,"text":" The current state council of ministers was sworn-in May 2016, after 2016 state elections.","title":"Kerala Council of Ministers"},{"sentence_id":2,"text":" The term of every executive wing is for 5 years.","title":"Kerala Council of Ministers"},{"sentence_id":3,"text":" The council of ministers are assisted by department secretaries attached to each ministry who are from IAS Kerala cadre.","title":"Kerala Council of Ministers"},{"sentence_id":4,"text":" The chief executive officer responsible for issuing orders on behalf of Government is Chief Secretary to the State Government.","title":"Kerala Council of Ministers"},{"sentence_id":5,"text":" The current Chief Secretary is Nalini Netto who took charge on April 1, 2017.","title":"Kerala Council of Ministers"}],"peer_messages":["Unverified peer answer: Vidkun Quisling
